    "updated_at": "2025-04-28T10:37:13Z",
    "body": "Alright. In that case I think it's best to leave this open as a feature request until we get sufficient interest from the tooling community to make it worth standardization. (Perhaps including a browser team that wants to implement the sort of thing you suggest.)",
